flowchart TD
    PR[PR or push to main] --> J[CI job db-tests]
    J --> S[supabase start: local Postgres + auth + pg_cron, in the runner]
    S --> D[Load schema-only dump of beta, read-only, BETA_DB_URL secret]
    D --> RT{PR adds migrations?}
    RT -- yes --> UP[apply up, fingerprint A] --> DN[apply .down.sql, fingerprint must equal baseline] --> UP2[apply up again, must equal A]
    RT -- no --> T
    UP2 --> T[supabase test db: pgTAP files in supabase/tests]
    T --> R[TAP report in job summary, fail on any not ok]
    style S fill:#2A1F6B,stroke:#7C4DFF,color:#EDEAFF
    style T fill:#2A1F6B,stroke:#7C4DFF,color:#EDEAFF
